{"unit_id":"Rice00__dsh-tree-view#card-zh","repo":"Rice00/dsh-tree-view","commit":"108575731c76b8ab813a96d60bf898d570bb2ef4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tree-view 是面向 DSH Web 的会话分支树形插件。它在 DSH 对话消息和会话视图中加入版本切换与 Tree 面板，并由主机端路由读取会话家族、创建编辑或重试分支。用户可以浏览分叉关系、跳转到某个版本、重命名分支、收起或恢复分支，并折叠长段连续轮次。适合需要比较不同提问版本、保留多条对话路线并管理侧栏会话的 DSH 用户。分支名称和归档归属保存在本机 DSH 存储中，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:30-45","lib/index.js:1076-1080","plugin.client.js:4073-4098","lib/tree-state.js:24-40"]}
{"unit_id":"Rice00__dsh-tree-view#card-en","repo":"Rice00/dsh-tree-view","commit":"108575731c76b8ab813a96d60bf898d570bb2ef4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tree-view adds a Tree view and branch navigation to DSH web conversations. Editing or retrying creates a session while preserving earlier versions. Users can inspect forks, switch versions, rename branches, and archive them. Labels and archive state stay local; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:30-45","lib/index.js:1076-1080","plugin.client.js:4073-4098","lib/tree-state.js:24-40"]}
